    "## 3. Energy-conserving background\n",
    "\n",
    "Split CDM into uncoupled and varying-mass populations:\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "\\rho_u=(1-F_d)\\rho_{c0}a^{-3},\\qquad\n",
    "\\rho_d=F_d\\rho_{c0}a^{-3}M(a).\n",
    "\\end{equation}\n",
    "\n",
    "The background energy transfer is fixed by the mass history,\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "\\frac{d\\rho_d}{d\\ln a}+3\\rho_d=q(a)\\rho_d,\n",
    "\\end{equation}\n",
    "\n",
    "so total conservation requires\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "\\frac{d\\rho_X}{d\\ln a}+3[1+w_X(a)]\\rho_X=-q(a)\\rho_d.\n",
    "\\end{equation}\n",
    "\n",
    "The axion-like EDE density is represented by\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{equation}\n",
    "\\rho_{\\rm EDE}(a)=\\rho_{{\\rm EDE},c}\n",
    "\\frac{2}{1+(a/a_c)^{3(1+w_f)}}.\n",
